  "releaseNotes": "### Changes since 7.6.x\n* Removed .NET Standard 2.1 TFM - .NET Standard 2.1 is implicitly supported through the .NET Standard 2.0 TFM\n* Removed deprecated code\n* Moved most LINQ style Span<T> and IEnumerable<T>, ICollection<T>, and IList<T> extensions out of DotExtensions to a different library\n* Reworked Span ``Resize`` method\n* Reworked Span CopyTo methods\n* Added Span ``TryCopyTo`` extension methods\n* Added Span ``OptimisticCopy`` extension methods\n* Changed ``RangeAsIList`` methods to return arrays and renamed them to ``RangeAsArray``\n* Removed no longer needed dependencies",
